Z||000019||Dgzfiero||09-29-2001||09:30 PM||||Hey Stimp, back when my car was running I always looked at the gas gauge. I only ran out one time on I-40 to figure out that walking sucks. On the integra thing I tried doing that to a 911 Targa(I was the flyby guy).I don't think he knew we were racing till we were going about 45 or so and my 2.5 was at redline in second.He stomped it and disappeared. As I tried to hit third I released the clutch a little to early and a terrible grinding noise came out of my car, I quickly turned down a side street and went home. ||||reg||1
