Z||000021||Spektrum-87GT||09-29-2001||10:30 PM||||funny you posted this, i had my first rice kill tonight! i'll try to sound as non-dramatic as possible. i pulled up to a light, next to a completely riced out non vtec integra, late 90s model, he was revving the heck out of his engine, light changed, we both went at it, i killed him all the way to 50, and then he gave up. sure was cool, bet he felt like a moron, by the way he was looking over and revving his engine, i thought for sure he had more than just a fart tip on the back. turned out to be another all show, no go ricer, <P>Better luck next time, red Integra boy!||||reg||1
